    values:originalText "(1.) Sectio n si x o f th e Jervis Bay Territory Acceptance Act 1915 i s repealed . (2.) Notwithstandin g th e last preceding sub-section, the provisions of th e Lands Acquisition Act 1906-1936 , as applie d b y sectio n si x of the Jervis Bay Territory Acceptance Act 1915 , continue t o appl y i n relation t o the acquisitio n o f land acquired , o r agreed t o be acquired, before th e commencemen t o f thi s Act , i n pursuanc e o f th e first - mentioned Ac t a s s o applied . (3.) Th e Jervis Bay Territory Acceptance Act 1915, as amended by this section , ma y b e cite d a s th e Jervis Bay Territory Acceptance Act 1915-1955. Dealings with Grown lands . Amendment of Seat of Government {Administration) Act 1930-1935 . Amendment of JrrvU Bay T-rrilory Aicep'ance Ad 1915 ." ;
